	)
	(text "J1 hand-soldered (DNP in assembly). F1 750 mA PTC.\nD1 SMF5.0A TVS after F1. U1 USBLC6-2P6 (SOT-666) at the plug.\nR1/R2 22 R series near the module (HDG).\nRev B: rev A DNP reserves C1, C2, R3 removed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.00 82.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d7fa21f-e961-5ef1-9be1-5afb68736c0b")
	)
	(text "U2 TLV76733DRVR (WSON-6) 5 V -> 3.3 V, 1 A: P = 1.7 V x 0.25 A avg = 0.43 W;\nEN tied to IN, SNS to OUT, thermal pad to the GND plane (vias).\nU3 TPS22917 soft-start: CT (C5) to VIN per TI DS pin table;\ntR = 1.6 us/pF x 2.2 nF = 3.5 ms (at 3.6 V).\nInrush = C x dV/dt = (22u + 10u + 0.1u + module) x 3.3 V / 3.5 ms = ~30 mA + module.\nQOD open: no quick output discharge on the main rail. Kept in rev B: the TLV767\ninternal 0.5 ms soft-start alone gives ~170 uC at attach (> 50 uC), see docs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.00 66.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73815e7b-8302-51c4-a6e3-69394cd60f6b")
	)
	(text "U5 SN74LV1T125 (74LVC1G125 symbol, same pinout): single-supply\ntranslator at VCC 5 V, VIH 2.03 V max -> 3.3 V input is valid. OE tied low.\nR9 holds DIN low during boot (LED dark). R10 100 R at DIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 274.00 70.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45091d5a-dff4-5c36-97d2-468b8588915b")
	)
	(text "EN RC: R4 10k / C9 1u (module DS). No reset button (rev B): replug.\nBOOT (IO0): R5 10k pull-up, no cap. Hold SW1 at reset -> download.\nRev B: no board-ID divider; board rev + role in factory NVS.\nIO1 unused (no connect)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.00 198.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e7b4be31-301b-57c9-9e74-173cd2a26de3")
	)
	(text "U4 = ESP32-S3-MINI-1-N8 only (IO35 used; no PSRAM variants).\nNative USB on IO19/IO20 (USB_D-/D+). C7 10u + C8 100n at the 3V3 pin.\nSDMMC via GPIO matrix: pin order follows the layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.00 198.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2eda14f2-5c0c-5c9f-84cf-669a862cd595")
	)
	(text "RX only: every part in this block is Fit=RX (not fitted on TX).\nU6 TPS22917: CT (C13 1 nF) to VIN, tR = ~1.6 ms. QOD tied to VOUT (fast discharge).\nR11 pulls ON high: SD power on by default; IO35 can switch it off.\nRN1 (4x10k array) + R22: pull-ups to the switched SD_VDD. No series R (rev B).\nJ3 SHOU HAN TF PUSH, bottom side, hand-soldered. CD to GND on insert [polarity unverified]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.00 199.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6b85b0c-ecd2-5666-8707-aaf10f0ceb1c")
	)
	(text "Fit field: ALL = TX + RX builds; RX = receiver only (DNP on TX); DNP = footprint only (X).\nTX build: microSD block not fitted, R7 = 22k. J1 hand-soldered in every build.\nInter-block nets use local labels; power symbols are sheet-local (net names /GND, /+3V3, /+5V).\nTest pads: bottom-side copper pads for the production pogo jig (not in BOM/CPL).\nThis sheet was laid out by tools/gen_sch.py once (2026-11-10);\nfilexfer-pcb.kicad_sch is now the master. Edit it in KiCad.\nDesign notes: docs/stage2-parts.md, docs/stage4-notes.md, docs/revB-notes.md, docs/schematic-style.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.00 230.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "784a9816-e515-5375-b53d-db2717015304")
	)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/"
			(page "1")
		)
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
